{
  "info": {
    "name": "AI Triage — Ticket and Document Integration",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Set baseUrl, organisationId and role tokens locally after import. Thuto supplies Keycloak setup and active memberships. No secrets are included. Run folders 1–3 in order, choosing a local file for upload. ticketId/documentId/first ruleId are captured after successful requests. Inspect candidate evidence before running individual folder 4 requests; do not run all governance decisions together. Use an effectiveFrom timestamp at or before now. Existing live AI settings select real providers; calls may incur usage. Disabled AI returns 503; disabled priority preview returns 503 PRIORITY_PREVIEW_DISABLED. Insufficient information/evidence and missing routing/SLA sources can be legitimate results. Folder 5 requires a permitted agent/team ticket. Collection creates real data in the selected backend: use development/test data."
  },
